      <a href="https://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=Renewal%20Drip&utm_medium=Email&utm_content=HomeHeader&utm_campaign=Renewal60Paid{!Opportunity.NF_Renewal_Rep__c}" target="_blank"><img src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001Xex0&oid=00D80000000diq5&lastMod=1345062060000" width="615" height="195" border="0" alt="You may be eligible for additional cash. National Funding." title="You may be eligible for additional cash. National Funding."></a>
